@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = dev-secret-key
@requestIdCreate = req-d60-order-001
@requestIdFetch = req-d60-order-002

### 1. List all orders (verifies structured JSON log + shared requestId)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
x-request-id: {{requestIdFetch}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 2. List orders filtered by area
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?area=bole
x-request-id: req-d60-filter-001
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 3. Create valid order with Authorization, x-api-key, and customerPhone (tests redaction + 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-request-id: {{requestIdCreate}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer super-secret-jwt-token

{
  "restaurant": "Yod Abyssinia",
  "area": "bole",
  "customerPhone": "+251911223344",
  "totalSantim": 85000
}

###

### 4. Fetch order by ID (verifies service log carries requestId without method argument)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/1
x-request-id: req-d60-get-one-001
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 5. Fetch missing order (verifies 404 Not Found + warning log)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/9999
x-request-id: req-d60-not-found-001
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 6. Invalid numeric order ID (verifies 400 Bad Request from ParseIntPipe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/not-a-number
x-request-id: req-d60-bad-id-001
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 7. Create invalid order body (verifies 400 Bad Request from ValidationPipe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-request-id: req-d60-invalid-body-001
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "restaurant": "",
  "area": "",
  "customerPhone": "",
  "totalSantim": -50
}

###

### 8. Check Swagger UI availability (200 in dev/non-production, 404 when NODE_ENV=production)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs
x-request-id: req-d60-docs-check-001

###

### 9. Check slow endpoint (optional — waits ~6s)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/slow
x-request-id: req-d60-slow-001
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}